close_reason: "Pins: @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.17 -> 2026.9.23, pm-ops 2026.9.13 -> 2026.9.23, pm-changelog 2026.9.16 -> 2026.9.23 (package.json and package-lock.json). Launcher: pm-ops template copied unchanged, replacing the .mjs implementation; test/prepare-merge-driver.test.ts proves byte identity and a real driver install. git config lists the pm merge drivers; the CI health block runs green with --require-merge-drivers; release:check exits 0."
